# TypeScript / Next.js Rules

- `strict: true` in tsconfig; avoid `any` unless justified with a comment.
- App Router: Server Components default; `"use client"` only when needed.
- No direct database or LLM calls from web — use API client in `lib/`.
- Environment: public vars only via `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.
- UI polish: follow taste-skill and ui-ux-pro-max when installed (see `docs/agent-setup.md`).
- Vietnamese UI copy is OK; component and function names in English.
